# Credentials
#
# Listed here as a reminder that this file holds live account passwords — but it
# IS tracked in this repo, the same way it is in the Python project, because the
# deployment reads it from the checkout. If this repo ever goes public, drop the
# tracked copy (`git rm --cached credentials.json`) and feed the addon through
# the CREDENTIALS_JSON environment variable instead.
